    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65010" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαργ-άω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάργος</span>)
		only in part.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαργῶν</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>raging</i>, esp. in battle,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				380
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ μαργῶντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					842
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόνου μαργῶντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					1005
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαργῶσαν χέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					1128
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι] μαργῶσαι φρένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1230
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				98a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαργῶσα γνάθος</span>
			<i>ravenous</i> jaw, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				258
			</span></i>: c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἱέναι
				δόρυ</span>
			<i>madly eager</i> to . . , <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1247
			</span></i>.</div>
